{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "DEU",
  "chapter": 33,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the with which Moses, the man of God, blessed the children of Israel before his death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said, the LORD came from Sinai, and rose up from Seir to them; he shined forth from mount Paran, and he came with ten thousands of saints: from his right hand ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "went",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a fiery law for them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, he loved the people; all his saints ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in thy hand: and they sat down at thy feet; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "every one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall receive of thy words.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Moses commanded us a law; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the inheritance of the congregation of Jacob.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he was king in Jeshurun, when the heads of the people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the tribes of Israel were assembled.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let Reuben live, and not die; and let ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his men be few.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is the blessing",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Judah: and he said, Hear, LORD, the voice of Judah, and bring him to his people: let his hands be sufficient for him, and be thou a help ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from his enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Levi he said, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy Thummim and thy Urim ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with thy holy one, whom thou didst prove at Massah, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and with",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " whom thou didst strive at the waters of Meribah;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who said to his father and to his mother, I have not seen him, neither did he acknowledge his brethren, nor know his own children: for they have observed thy word, and kept thy covenant.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall teach Jacob thy judgments, and Israel thy law; they shall put incense before thee, and whole burnt sacrifice upon thy altar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bless, LORD, his substance, and accept the work of his hands: smite through the loins of them that rise against him, and of them that hate him, that they rise not again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Benjamin he said, The beloved of the LORD shall dwell in safety by him; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the LORD",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall cover him all the day long, and he shall dwell between his shoulders.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Joseph he said, Blessed of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his land, for the precious things of heaven, for the dew, and for the deep that coucheth beneath,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And for the precious fruits ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "brought forth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by the sun, and for the precious things put forth by the moon,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And for the chief things of the ancient mountains, and for the precious things of the lasting hills,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And for the precious things of the earth and fullness of it, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the good will of him that dwelt in the bush; let ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the blessing",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " come upon the head of Joseph, and upon the top of the head of him that was separated from his brethren.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His glory ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the firstling of his bullock, and his horns ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the horns of unicorns: with them he shall push the people together to the ends of the earth: and they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the ten thousands of Ephraim, and they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the thousands of Manasseh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Zebulun he said, Rejoice, Zebulun, in thy going out; and Issachar, in thy tents.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall call the people to the mountain; there they shall offer sacrifices of righteousness: for they shall suck ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the abundance of the seas, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " treasures hid in the sand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Gad he said: Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that enlargeth Gad: he dwelleth as a lion, and teareth the arm with the crown of the head.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he provided the first part for himself, because there, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a portion of the lawgiver, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was he",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " seated: and he came with the heads of the people, he executed the justice of the LORD, and his judgments with Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Dan he said, Dan ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a lion's whelp: he shall leap from Bashan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Naphtali he said, O Naphtali, satisfied with favor, and full with the blessing of the LORD: possess thou the west and the south.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Asher he said, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Asher ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " blessed with children; let him be acceptable to his brethren, and let him dip his foot in oil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy shoes ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " iron and brass; and as thy days, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy strength ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none like to the God of Jeshurun, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " rideth upon the heaven in thy help, and in his excellence on the sky.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The eternal God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is thy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " refuge, and underneath ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the everlasting arms: and he shall thrust out the enemy from before thee, and shall say, Destroy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Israel then shall dwell in safety alone; the fountain of Jacob ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon a land of corn and wine, also his heavens shall drop down dew.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEU.33.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:DEU.33.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Happy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou, O Israel: who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " like to thee, O people saved by the LORD, the shield of thy help, and who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sword of thy excellence! and thy enemies shall be found liars to thee; and thou shalt tread upon their high places.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
